        <item>
            <title>1.14.2</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:18:15 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>251</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.14.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>Apps whose Homebrew download comes from the developer&#x27;s GitHub releases are now also checked against those releases, so a new version shows on Updates even before Homebrew lists it (Vorssaint 3.4.5, for example).</li>
  <li>While Keel checks, &quot;updates found so far&quot; counts only updates that will appear on Updates; versions Keel is holding back, and apps you ignored, snoozed or skipped, no longer count.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
