        <item>
            <title>1.14.1</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:32:29 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>247</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.14.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>An app whose installer renames it is no longer reported as failed: after an update, Keel finds the app again by its identifier, counts the update when the new version is there, and says so (&quot;Updated to 158.0.4370.33 · now Copilot.app&quot;). Keel&#x27;s list, reopening and later updates use the new name. This happened with Microsoft 365 Copilot, which Microsoft renamed to Copilot.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
